{# The members-library showcase on the All-Access sales pages.
   Renders entirely from site/_data/library.json off the page's own `lang`.

   This exists because the three All-Access pages hand-wrote the same list and
   all three decayed: on Aug 13, 2026 they were still selling a members area of
   "flexibility, kettlebell, fixing lower back pain" — one deleted that morning,
   two that never existed — while naming none of the eight real entries.

   Shipping a tool is now one edit to library.json, in three languages, and
   every sales page updates. Do not hand-write entries back into the pages.

   Grouped by `category` since Sep 4, 2026 — the flat grid of 13 gave a reader
   no way to tell what was for them. Same three buckets as the members home,
   same source. The card above this section must NOT re-list individual tools:
   it did until Sep 4 and named six of the thirteen, which read as duplication
   and went stale ("Ocho herramientas" while the real count was 13). #}
{%- set lib = library[lang] or library.es -%}
{%- set order = lib.categoryOrder or ["train", "pain", "numbers"] -%}
<section class="section--wash" id="biblioteca">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>{{ lib.heading }}</h2>
    <p class="section-intro">{{ lib.intro }}</p>

    <span class="lib-label">{{ lib.liveLabel }}</span>
    {%- for cat in order %}
      {%- if lib.categoryCounts[cat] %}
    <div class="lib-group">
      <h3 class="lib-group-title">{{ lib.categories[cat] }}</h3>
      <div class="grid-3 lib-grid">
        {%- for item in lib.live %}{% if item.category == cat %}
        <div class="include-card">
          <span class="tag">{{ item.tag }}</span>
          <h3>{{ item.name }}</h3>
          <p>{{ item.desc }}</p>
        </div>
        {%- endif %}{% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
      {%- endif %}
    {%- endfor %}

    <div class="lib-soon">
      <h3 class="lib-soon-title">{{ lib.soonHeading }}</h3>
      <p class="lib-soon-intro">{{ lib.soonIntro }}</p>
      <ul class="lib-soon-list">
        {%- for item in lib.soon %}
        <li><strong>{{ item.name }}</strong> — {{ item.desc }}</li>
        {%- endfor %}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
